## 5. FIX PDF COMPRESSION AND TARGET-SIZE COMPRESSION

The existing compression implementation does not always achieve a meaningful reduction in file size.

Sometimes the output barely changes. In other cases, the output is much larger or the requested target is not achieved.

Review the existing compression service and repair it.

The application must clearly distinguish between:

1. Standard compression.
2. Stronger compression.
3. Image-oriented or rasterizing compression.
